<urn:researchmaster:aorta:req:9793aa16-9464-ed7f-8be1-98a70758c4b7> a rm:Requirement;
    dcterms:identifier "9793AA16-9464-ED7F-8BE1-98A70758C4B7";
    dcterms:title "JSON Web Key";
    ea:alias "DVZA.MAT.e4050";
    dcterms:description """<b>Eis:</b>

De JWK bevat de volgende attributen, waar de definitie van de attributen kan worden gevonden in RFC 7517 en RFC 7518:
<ul>
	<li>"kty":"RSA";</li>
	<li>"alg":"RS256";</li>
	<li>"use":"sig";</li>
	<li>"kid":"&lt;the identifier of the key-pair used to sign this JWT&gt;";</li>
	<li>"x5c":"&lt;de van toepassing zijnde keten van PKIX certificaten&gt;";</li>
	<li>"n":"&lt;the modulus value for the RSA public key&gt;";</li>
	<li>"e":"&lt;the exponent value for the RSA public key&gt;".</li>
</ul>
<b>
</b><b>Toelichting bij eis:</b>""";
