    <https://researchmaster.example.org/vocab/ea/tag/Vzvz_Req_Verificatie> "Documentverificatie";
    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <urn:researchmaster:aorta:req:99229948-ba6c-f1a1-a1b5-9536f761d755> .

<urn:researchmaster:aorta:req:a9df800e-4d55-6a52-88c5-0f418fc014dd> a rm:Requirement;
